---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---
<section id="services" class="service-paths" aria-labelledby="services-title">
	<div class="paths-inner">
		<div class="paths-heading">
			<div><p class="paths-eyebrow">Work with me</p><h2 id="services-title">Two ways to put me to work.</h2></div>
			<p>Ongoing as your fractional developer, or a one-off project quoted in writing. Either way it is hands-on work with me personally.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="paths-grid">
			<article class="path-card">
				<p class="paths-eyebrow">Ongoing · build and improve your website or product</p>
				<h3>Fractional Web &amp;<br />Product Developer</h3>
				<p>I build and improve websites, web applications, and internal tools, from the user interface to features, APIs, integrations, maintenance, and deployment. The technical foundation search engines and AI tools need (schema, crawler access, structure, speed) goes first in the queue.</p>
				<p class="path-scope"><strong>The focus:</strong> a working website or product, shipped features, and a codebase your business can keep using.</p>
				<p class="path-proof"><strong>Relevant work</strong><br />It’s an Art Party Directory · TrueTourney</p>
				<a href="https://www.scalevisibility.com/fractional-web-developer/" class="path-link">Explore web &amp; product development <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
			</article>
			<article class="path-card">
				<p class="paths-eyebrow">One-off · a project with a finish line</p>
				<h3>Website rebuild or<br />AI Visibility Implementation</h3>
				<p>A complete rebuild when the site you have is too far gone, or every fix from an AI visibility audit made on the site you already have, verified live.</p>
				<p class="path-scope"><strong>The focus:</strong> a scoped project, quoted in writing before you commit, with a result you can sign off.</p>
				<p class="path-proof"><strong>Relevant work</strong><br />Scale Visibility · Astro + Headless WordPress</p>
				<a href="https://www.scalevisibility.com/services/" class="path-link">Explore the one-off projects <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
			</article>
		</div>
		<div class="paths-foot">
			<p>Need a project alongside the ongoing role? We’ll agree on the scope and capacity together, with overlapping work counted once.</p>
		</div>
		<p class="scale-path">Not sure which fits? <a href="mailto:joshua.winningham@gmail.com?subject=Work%20with%20Josh%20Winningham">Email me about what you need.</a></p>
		<p class="scale-path">Both are offered through <a href="https://www.scalevisibility.com/services/">Scale Visibility</a>, the practice I founded: the service pages, quotes, and invoicing live there, and you still work with me directly. Not sure where your site stands? Run the <a href="https://www.scalevisibility.com/audit/">free AI visibility score</a>.</p>
	</div>
</section>
<style>
	.service-paths { scroll-margin-top: 90px; background: var(--bg-alt); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.paths-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 68px 32px; }
	.paths-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 32px; }
	.paths-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--fg2); margin: 0 0 16px; }
	h2, h3 { font-family: "Newsreader", serif; font-weight: 450; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; }
	h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 3.5vw, 46px); }
	h3 { font-size: clamp(29px, 3vw, 38px); }
	.paths-heading > p { color: var(--fg2); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
	.paths-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; }
	.path-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-top: 3px solid var(--primary); background: var(--card); border-radius: 3px 3px 12px 12px; }
	.path-card:nth-child(2) { border-top-color: var(--accent); }
	.path-card > p:not(.paths-eyebrow) { color: var(--fg2); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 22px 0 0; }
	.path-card strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
	.path-card .path-proof { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 18px; font-size: 13px !important; margin-bottom: 24px !important; }
	.path-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: auto; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--line2); text-underline-offset: 5px; }
	.path-link:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--accent); }
	.paths-foot { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-top: 28px; }
	.paths-foot p, .scale-path { color: var(--fg2); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
	.paths-foot p { max-width: 62ch; }
	.paths-foot a, .scale-path a { color: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
	.scale-path { margin-top: 18px; }
	@media (max-width: 800px) { .paths-heading, .paths-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; } .paths-heading > p { max-width: 55ch; } }
	@media (max-width: 600px) { .paths-inner { padding: 48px 18px; } .path-card { padding: 24px; } }
</style>
